<import src="../../templates/shared.wxml"/>
<view class="page"><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><template wx:if="{{!vehicle && !error}}" is="onboarding"/><block wx:if="{{vehicle}}"><template is="vehicle-switch" data="{{vehicle,vehicles,vehicleIndex}}"/><view class="title">花在哪里，一目了然</view>
<view class="filters" wx:if="{{multi}}"><button class="filter {{scope === 'vehicle' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-scope="vehicle" bindtap="scopeChange">当前车辆</button><button class="filter {{scope === 'all' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-scope="all" bindtap="scopeChange">全部车辆合计</button></view>
<picker mode="date" fields="month" value="{{month}}" end="{{today}}" bindchange="monthChange"><view class="picker">{{month}} 月度费用 ▾</view></picker><view class="card spaced"><view class="muted">本月已记支出</view><view class="amount">¥{{amount}}</view><view wx:for="{{categories}}" wx:key="kind"><view class="plan-title"><text>{{item.name}}</text><text>¥{{item.amount}}</text></view><view class="bar"><view class="bar-fill" style="width:{{item.percent}}%"></view></view><view class="tiny" wx:if="{{item.kind === 'other' && others}}">{{others}}</view></view></view>
<view class="grid"><view class="card"><view class="tiny">{{year}} 年已记支出</view><view class="metric">¥{{yearAmount}}</view><view class="tiny">{{yearCount}} 笔</view></view><view class="card"><view class="tiny">累计已记支出</view><view class="metric">¥{{totalAmount}}</view><view class="tiny">{{firstDate ? '自 ' + firstDate + ' 起' : '还没有记录'}}</view></view></view>
<view class="section"><text class="section-title">近 12 个月</text></view><view class="card"><view class="trend-row" wx:for="{{trend}}" wx:key="month"><text class="trend-label">{{item.month}}</text><view class="bar trend-bar"><view class="bar-fill" style="width:{{item.percent}}%"></view></view><text class="trend-amount">¥{{item.amount}}</text></view></view>
<block wx:if="{{scope === 'vehicle'}}"><view class="section"><text class="section-title">行驶里程</text></view><view class="card" wx:if="{{miles}}"><view class="tiny">日均行驶</view><view class="metric">{{miles.daily}}<text class="unit">km</text></view><view class="tiny">年行驶约 {{miles.yearly}} km · 按 {{miles.from}} 至 {{miles.to}} 的里程读数估算</view></view><view class="muted" wx:else>里程读数跨度不足 14 天，暂不估算日均里程。</view>
<view class="section"><text class="section-title">历史完整区间能耗</text></view><view class="tiny">以下按全部历史完整区间加权统计，不随上方月份筛选。</view><view class="card spaced" wx:for="{{energy}}" wx:key="name"><view class="muted">{{item.name}}</view><view class="metric">{{item.result.rate || '—'}}<text class="unit">{{item.unit}}</text></view><block wx:if="{{item.result.rate}}"><view class="tiny">{{item.result.intervals.length}} 个有效区间 · {{item.result.km}} km · 能源成本 ¥{{item.result.costPerKm}}/km</view><view class="row-meta" wx:for="{{item.recent}}" wx:for-item="seg" wx:key="toId">{{seg.from}} 至 {{seg.to}} · {{seg.km}} km · {{seg.rate}} {{item.unit}}</view></block><view class="tiny" wx:else>{{item.result.hint}}</view></view><view class="notice">油耗采用满箱法；充电侧电耗只使用充电后电量相同、且用户确认记录完整的区间，可能包含充电损耗。能源成本是这些区间内的补能花费除以里程。插混的油量与电量均按各自区间总里程计算，不代表纯油或纯电模式能耗，也不能相加。</view></block>
<view class="notice" wx:else>能耗与里程按单车计算，切回「当前车辆」即可查看。</view></block></view>
